[5] Proof readout
  Add the pi/unital ideas as conservative carriers, not proof scalars.
  The flower's 22-family quotient is useful because 1/pi ~= 7/22
  and +7 is a unit step on Z/22; it should be compared to unit-visible
  C27 shell holes, not to a literal full-circle period.
  The cuberoot(31) signal points to the q=3 unital package
  31=27+4, linking C=27 with a block size 4 pair-design carrier.
  The next theorem target is unchanged but better typed:
    after exact M/Farey branch and C27 transfer are attached,
    try a q=3 unital/pair-unique packet as a finite pair-coverage
    interface for the p>=3 K33 owner branch or HYP-2908 state lift.
  Guardrail:
    none of 22/7, cuberoot(31), or the word 'unital' replaces q,
    exact M(S), or the C27/K33 branch labels.
